+# P0/P1 optimization cycle — 2026-08-11
+
+**Base:** `ms178/lccc` `main` at
+`05b3770f2a69b31a08b3d36d36f3c71f3809d63f`.
+
+All measurements below are CPU-0-pinned KVM screening measurements.  They are
+useful for ranking code-generation work, but are not Raptor Lake PMU claims.
+The raw data and every incremental binary patch are preserved in the workspace
+under `/home/user/lccc-patch-snapshots/`.
+
+| ID | Priority | Change | Evidence / result | Incremental patch snapshot |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | P1 | Raise the acyclic static-leaf inline cap from 12 to 16 blocks. | Expat UTF-8 classifier: removes the hot `xml_name_start` call; 21 paired rounds: 159.965 ms → 130.965 ms, **1.222×**; `.text` +165 B. | `001-p1-acyclic-static-leaf-inline.patch` |
+| 2 | P1 | Bound static-loop inlining by IR size, CFG size, and direct clone count. | zlib-ng Adler kernel: 31 paired rounds: 81.693 ms → 67.785 ms, **1.206×**; `.text` 2530 → 2083 B.  Small loop helpers still inline freely; larger helpers require ≤2 direct call sites. | `002-p1-bounded-static-loop-inlining.patch` |
+| 3 | P0 | Skip nested/overlapping natural loops in IVSR. | Fixes forced-IVSR nested matmul wrong result; all 24 canonical benchmarks match GCC with IVSR enabled. | `003-p0-ivsr-nested-loop-safety.patch` |
+| 4 | P1 | Enable the now-safe disjoint-loop IVSR pass by default. | `loop_patterns`: 31 paired rounds: **1.122×**; no code-size growth. `CCC_NO_IVSR=1` retains a diagnostic escape hatch. | `004-p1-enable-safe-ivsr-by-default.patch` |
+| 5 | P1 | Coalesce semantically equivalent `(IV, stride, base)` address expressions into one pointer recurrence. | Removes duplicate IV phis/updates for independently-numbered `a[i]` expressions; `loop_patterns` `.text` 1664 → 1640 B and 31-round median ratio 0.9904. | `005-p1-coalesce-equivalent-ivsr-addresses.patch` |
+| 6 | P0 | Repair the latest-main volatile stack-slot regression assertion. | Pristine latest main fails the test.  The corrected test verifies the post-load zero remains while allowing the dead pre-load zero to disappear. Final Rust suite passes. | `006-p0-volatile-zero-fact-regression.patch` |
+
+## Correctness gates completed after the final state
+
+- `cargo test --release --locked -j 2`: **578 passed, 0 failed, 6 ignored**.
+- Canonical LCCC/GCC benchmark correctness suite: **24/24 output matches**.
+- Differential fuzzer: **300/300** defined-behavior cases across `O2,O3,Os`.
+- CFG/phi differential fuzzer: **200/200** cases across `O2,O3`.
+- The P0 nested-loop IVSR guard has a unit test and a full matrix-multiply
+  runtime reproducer.
+
+## Rejected research spikes
+
+These were measured, documented, and deliberately not retained:
+
+| Experiment | Reason rejected |
+|---|---|
+| Large acyclic decoder inlining (`sqlite_get_varint`) | 31 paired rounds: 1.0028 ratio with +1119 B `.text`; no runtime gain. |
+| Lexical loop-depth inline-site priority | zlib 31-pair ratio 1.0481 and `.text` growth; source order selected better code. |
+| Invoking dormant `univsr` after IVSR | Miscompiled `loop_patterns` prefix sum (`492040` → `244916`); needs a full SSA/use-def repair before reconsideration. |
+
+The associated rejection notes are retained as `003-`, `004-`, and `005-`
