+|---|---|
+| `gzip_crc32.c` | `GNU-LGPL-3.0-or-later.txt` |
+| `zlib_ng_adler32.c` | `Zlib.txt` |
+| `expat_xml_scan.c` | `Expat-MIT.txt` |
+| `sqlite_varint.c` | `SQLite-public-domain.txt` |
+| `linux_find_bit.c` | `Linux-GPL-2.0-or-later.txt` |
